  // ---- Cutaway (stage layout): the view moves into one storage element and its layers come off. `cut` 0..1 swaps the
  // views (the plant grows towards the element it is leaving through and fades; the element arrives); `strip` 0..n takes
  // off layer 1, then layer 2. Each layer slides along the element's axis as it goes.
